  "content": "<p>一個為出色的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin</a>mod所做的資源包，讓我的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cherry-hunger-bar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cherry Hunger Bar</a>可以與之配合運作。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_54e7b3c8-2e6a-4ee9-8ba1-84c12ef6b632.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"252\"></p><hr><p>請確保該資源包位於「資源包」選單中的Appskin mod上方。</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p>",
